"><div><div class="ps387 ss175"><span class="f charStyle-791788a1 ps51">Total amortización acumulada del <span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div><div class="ps404 ss175"><span class="f charStyle-791788a1 ps51">inmovilizado intangible</span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2517 ss68"><div><div class="ps332 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-791788a1 ps2471">(807)<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2518 ss68"><div><div class="ps332 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-791788a1 ps866">(44)<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2520 ss37"><div><div class="ps332 ss34"><span class="f charStyle-791788a1 ps2519">190<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2521 ss68"><div><div class="ps332 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-791788a1 ps2471">(661)<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2522 ss177"><div><div class="ps298 ss175"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps51">Valor neto contable<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2523 ss65"><div><div class="ps298 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps2450">133<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2524 ss65"><div><div class="ps298 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps895">26<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2526 ss131"><div><div class="ps298 ss34"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps2525">(3)<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2527 ss65"><div><div class="ps298 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps2450">156<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="ps2533 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">En los ejercicios </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2529">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2530"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2531">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2532">, los gastos del personal propio que ha trabajado en proyectos </span></div><div class="ps2536 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">de sistemas informáticos, incluidos como mayor coste de dichos proyectos, ascienden a </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2534">11</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2535"> y </span></div><div class="ps2538 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">10</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2537"> millones de euros, respectivamente.</span></div><div class="ps2539 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257"> no existen activos intangibles en garantía de préstamos </span></div><div class="ps2540 ss22"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">bancarios.</span></div><div class="ps2541 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257"> no existen importes de inmovilizado intangible adquirido a </span></div><div class="ps2544 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">empresas del grupo y asociadas. Asimismo, durante el ejercicio </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2542">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2543"> se han enajenado </span></div><div class="ps2547 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">elementos de inmovilizado intangible a empresas del grupo por importe de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2545">31</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2546"> millones de </span></div><div class="ps2552 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">euros (</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2548">3</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2549"> millones de euros durante el ejercicio </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2550">2024<span class="f ps4"> </span></span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2551">).</span></div><div class="ps2553 ss22"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">IBERDROLA no posee elementos de inmovilizado inmaterial cuyos derechos pudieran </span></div><div class="ps2558 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">ejercitarse fuera del territorio español en los ejercicios </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2554">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2555"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2556">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2557">.</span></div><div class="ps2559 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257"> el importe de los activos intangibles en explotación <span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div><div class="ps2564 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">totalmente amortizados asciende a </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2560">274</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2561"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2562">242</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2563"> millones de euros, respectivamente, de los <span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div><div class="ps2568 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">cuales </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2565">238</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps1767"> y <span class="f ps4"> </span></span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2566">212</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2567"> millones de euros corresponden a aplicaciones informáticas, </span></div><div class="ps2569 ss22"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">respectivamente.</span></div></div></div><div class="pageView" style="--justify:justify;height:841.95pt;width:595.35pt"><div class="ps1468 fo"><div style="width:453pt"><div class="ps924 ss22"><div class="ss10 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:324pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:129pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:24.75pt"><td style="border-top:1pt solid #00a443;padding:0"></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #00a443;padding:0"><div class="ps48 ss9"><div><div class="ps47 ss8"><div class="ps46"><div class="ps1"><span class="image-2ef6a85a7384a6a81ea46165be8e0060d1a812b5b92e6320915b0d070cb41e7e" style="height:24.56pt;width:70.87pt"></span></div></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ps1 fo"><div style="width:467pt"><div class="ps42 ss22"><div class="ss138 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:240pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:181.5pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:27.75pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:41.25pt"><td style="padding:0"><div class="ps1 ss133"><div><div class="ps1224 ss132" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-9c0f18c6 ps51">Informe financiero anual </span><span class="f charStyle-9c0f18c6 ps1223">2025</span></div></div></div></td><td style="padding:0"><div class="ps1465 ss135"><div><div class="ps1224 ss134"><span class="f charStyle-be0079b2 ps1464">Iberdrola, S.A.<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="padding:0"><div class="ps1467 ss137"><div><div class="ps1228 ss136"><span class="f charStyle-96cb1c74 ps1587">| 31</span></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="ps14 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> se mantienen compromisos firmes de adquisición de bienes del </span></div><div class="ps1594 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">inmovilizado intangible por importe de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2570">3</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2571"> millones de euros (</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2572">7</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2573"> millones de euros a 31 de </span></div><div class="ps1595 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps1786">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps1787">). A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2574">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2575"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2576">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2577"> no existen compromisos firmes de </span></div><div class="ps1598 ss22"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">venta de bienes del inmovilizado intangible.</span></div><div class="ps2580 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">Los costes incurridos en actividades de investigación y desarrollo ascienden a </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2578">41</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2579"> millones </span></div><div class="ps2587 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">de euros en el ejercicio </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2581">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2582"> (</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2583">39</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2584"> millones de euros en </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2585">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2586">).</span></div><div class="ps2589 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-78791bf4 ps26">8. Inmovilizado material<span id="ie1167fc568774d78846e0ca6fc6d1e3c"></span></span></div><div class="ps2594 ss22" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">La composición y movimientos del inmovilizado material en los ejercicios </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2590">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2591"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2592">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2593">, </span></div><div class="ps2595 ss22"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">expresados en millones de euros,</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2420"> han sido los siguientes:</span></div><div class="ps2666 ss22"><div class="ss145 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:125.25pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:60pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:60pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:71.25pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:62.25pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:60pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:26.25pt"><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps1 ss183"><div><div class="ps332 ss182"><span class="f charStyle-e10141a0 ps51">sin dato<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2596 ss68"><div><div class="ps298 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-97e60454 ps2423">Saldo a <span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div><div class="ps329 ss64"><span class="f charStyle-97e60454 ps2424">01.01.2025</span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0"><div class="ps2597 ss68"><