ado material.</span></div><div class="ps2743 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">En los ejercicios </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2529">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2530"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2531">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2532">, no se han incluido gastos de personal relacionados directa o </span></div><div class="ps2744 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">indirectamente con el inmovilizado en curso, como mayor coste de dichos activos.</span></div><div class="ps2745 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257"> no existen importes de inmovilizado material adquirido a </span></div><div class="ps2746 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">empresas del grupo y asociadas. Asimismo, durante el ejercicio </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2542">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2543"> se han enajenado </span></div><div class="ps2749 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">elementos de inmovilizado material a empresas del grupo por importe de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2747">9</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2748"> millones de euros </span></div><div class="ps2752 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">(ningún importe durante el ejercicio </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2750">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2751">).</span></div><div class="ps2753 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">IBERDROLA no posee elementos de inmovilizado material situados fuera del territorio </span></div><div class="ps2758 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">español en los ejercicios </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2754">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2755"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2756">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2757">.</span></div><div class="ps2759 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257"> el importe de las instalaciones materiales y otro </span></div><div class="ps2762 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">inmovilizado material en explotación totalmente amortizados tiene un valor de coste de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2760">343</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2761"> y </span></div><div class="ps2764 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">335</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2763"> millones de euros, respectivamente, de los cuales ningún importe correspondía a </span></div><div class="ps2765 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">construcciones.</span></div><div class="ps2766 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257"> IBERDROLA no mantiene activos materiales en garantía </span></div><div class="ps2767 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">de préstamos bancarios.</span></div><div class="ps2772 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">A 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2254">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2255"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2256">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2257">, el saldo del inmovilizado material recoge </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2768">81</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2769"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2770">82</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2771"> millones </span></div><div class="ps2773 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">de euros, respectivamente, correspondientes al valor neto contable del terreno y del edificio </span></div><div class="ps2774 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">corporativo de IBERDROLA en Madrid que es objeto de un contrato de arrendamiento </span></div><div class="ps2777 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">financiero. El importe por el que se reconoció inicialmente el activo ascendió a </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2775">104</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2776"> millones </span></div><div class="ps2778 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">de euros, correspondiente al valor actual de los pagos mínimos a realizar en la fecha de </span></div><div class="ps2779 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">reconocimiento inicial.</span></div></div></div><div class="pageView" style="--justify:justify;height:842pt;width:595pt"><div class="ps43 fo"><div style="width:453pt"><div class="ps924 ss0"><div class="ss10 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:324pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:129pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:24.75pt"><td style="border-top:1pt solid #00a443;padding:0"></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #00a443;padding:0"><div class="ps48 ss9"><div><div class="ps47 ss8"><div class="ps46"><div class="ps1"><span class="image-2ef6a85a7384a6a81ea46165be8e0060d1a812b5b92e6320915b0d070cb41e7e" style="height:24.56pt;width:70.87pt"></span></div></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ps1 fo"><div style="width:467pt"><div class="ps42 ss0"><div class="ss138 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:240pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:181.5pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:27.75pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:41.25pt"><td style="padding:0"><div class="ps1 ss133"><div><div class="ps1224 ss132" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-9c0f18c6 ps51">Informe financiero anual </span><span class="f charStyle-9c0f18c6 ps1223">2025</span></div></div></div></td><td style="padding:0"><div class="ps1465 ss135"><div><div class="ps1224 ss134"><span class="f charStyle-be0079b2 ps1464">Iberdrola, S.A.<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="padding:0"><div class="ps1467 ss137"><div><div class="ps1228 ss136"><span class="f charStyle-96cb1c74 ps1587">| 33</span></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="ps14 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">La información relativa a los pagos mínimos por dicho contrato de arrendamiento financiero </span></div><div class="ps1594 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">a 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2781">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2782">, expresada en millones de euros,</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps2783"> es la siguiente:</span></div><div class="ps2376 ss0"><div class="ss10 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:372.75pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:80.25pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:13.5pt"><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-lef