8 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">contraparte la opción de vender dichas acciones a la fecha de vencimiento al precio de </span></div><div class="ps4289 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">ejercicio fijado en el contrato.</span></div><div class="ps4292 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">L</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps4290">as características de estos contratos a 31 de diciembre de </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps291">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps292"> y </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps293">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps294"> </span><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps4291">se describen a </span></div><div class="ps4293 ss0"><span class="f charStyle-ea3d506d ps26">continuación:</span></div><div class="ps4314 ss0"><div class="ss138 ws0 ps45"><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;font-size:initial;padding:0;table-layout:fixed;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="height:0"><td style="padding:0;width:114pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:81.75pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:81.75pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:90pt"></td><td style="padding:0;width:81.75pt"></td></tr><tr style="height:24pt"><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps1 ss451"><div><div class="ps3202 ss450"><span class="f charStyle-97e60454 ps872">2025<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4295 ss453"><div><div class="ps3202 ss452"><span class="f charStyle-97e60454 ps4294">Nº de acciones<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#007f33;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt s