></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4308 ss457"><div><div class="ps332 ss452"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps1551">12,3521<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4311 ss458"><div><div class="ps298 ss454"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4309">17/01/2025 a <span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div><div class="ps329 ss454"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4310">20/06/2025</span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4313 ss457"><div><div class="ps332 ss452"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4315">1.027<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="ps4317 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-375804c7 ps3591"><sup>(1)</sup></span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps3592"> El importe se presenta neto de las primas cobradas por importe de </span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps192">20</span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps4316"> millones de euros a 31 de diciembre de </span></div><div class="ps4323 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps3598">2025</span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps4318"> y de </span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps4319">10</span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps4320"> millones de euros a 31 de diciembre </span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps4321">2024</span><span class="f charStyle-02e55fcf ps4322">.</span></div><div id="id9a6c717e18948d0a392eab1a21cd936_139102" style="position:absolute;top:175.9pt"></div><div class="ps4325 ss0" style="font-size:12pt"><span class="