pan class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4471">0<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps360 ss503"><div><div class="ps387 ss502"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps51">Pagos y otros<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4666 ss142"><div><div class="ps298 ss141"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4650">(7)<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4667 ss142"><div><div class="ps298 ss141"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4650">(1)<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps365 ss503"><div><div class="ps298 ss502"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps657">Saldo a 31.12.2025<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4668 ss142"><div><div class="ps298 ss141"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps4578">100<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#fff5ec;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4669 ss142"><div><div class="ps298 ss141"><span class="f charStyle-8bd84864 ps2787">7<span cl