lass="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">1<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4769 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">0<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4770 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">1<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps3093 ss392"><div><div class="ps298 ss387"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps657">Plan de reestructuración 2020<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4771 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">1<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4772 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">7<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4773 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">1<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4774 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">9<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4775 ss392"><div><div class="ps298 ss387"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps657">Plan de reestructuración 2021<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4776 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">2<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4778 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4777">13<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4779 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps3922">3<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4780 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4777">13<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4781 ss392"><div><div class="ps298 ss387"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps51">Plan de reestructuración 2023<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4782 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4777">10<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4783 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4777">25<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4785 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4784">12<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4786 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps4784">25<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td></tr><tr style="height:14.25pt"><td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps2695 ss392"><div><div class="ps298 ss387"><span class="f charStyle-024643f9 ps51">Plan de reestructuración 2024<span class="f ps4"> </span></span></div></div></div></td><td style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000;padding:0"><div class="ps4787 ss393"><div><div class="ps298 ss390"><span class="f charStyle